| `MAKEFLAGS` | string | unset; make sets it for a recipe | GNU make's flag word, options and `--` variables | `scripts/gate_evidence.py` | `n`, `q` or `t` makes the writer forward the dry run and write nothing; `k` makes it run every goal after a failure; the flags and command-line variables are forwarded to each goal as arguments. | a child's environment, which `build_child_env` never gives it | always |
